    decoding="async"
  />
  <figcaption>The threshold is already there. The new direction has already started.</figcaption>
</figure>
<p>
  Sometimes that first step of letting go is painful. Sometimes it is welcomed.
  It's a blessing if letting go of an unhealthy old direction turns out to be
  welcomed instead of painful. Even if it is painful, that is a blessing too.
  Nothing is wasted when you are growing toward that which is healthy.
</p>
<p>
  Sometimes, after letting go, it takes a while before you can perceive the
  new direction. Rest assured: if you have truly let go of the old one, the new
  direction has already started.
</p>
<p>
  The goal is to go a new direction that is healthier than the one you left,
  whether you wanted to leave it or not.
</p>
